When someone's owed money he can't collect, what's he do?

01:14:06.970 --> 01:14:08.030
He goes to the law.

01:14:08.940 --> 01:14:09.340
Wait a minute.

01:14:12.680 --> 01:14:14.380
What was your share supposed to be?

01:14:14.700 --> 01:14:16.730
What do you think you're doing?

01:14:17.320 --> 01:14:19.640
You're going to let every cheap chisel who comes along cut him?

01:14:19.700 --> 01:14:20.620
What's going to happen to us?

01:14:21.560 --> 01:14:22.160
They're mine.

01:14:27.370 --> 01:14:28.790
You're a gent, Mr. Curtis.

01:14:29.190 --> 01:14:29.830
Not like her.

01:14:30.350 --> 01:14:31.790
Sit down.

01:14:34.910 --> 01:14:37.920
I'll say, please, and this.

01:14:41.250 --> 01:14:41.710
Thanks, Governor.

01:14:44.530 --> 01:14:45.430
Don't worry about me.

01:14:46.300 --> 01:14:48.480
They can put a knife at me throat and get nothing out of me.

01:14:48.620 --> 01:14:50.030
Good luck.

01:14:52.640 --> 01:14:53.720
You had no right to do that.

01:14:54.400 --> 01:14:55.300
Who do you think you are?

01:14:55.710 --> 01:14:56.710
They're mine, mine.

01:14:57.980 --> 01:14:58.340
Helen!

01:15:01.020 --> 01:15:02.580
out of your mind. You're crazy.

01:15:27.060 --> 01:15:27.560
The man.

01:15:45.100 --> 01:15:46.140
to get to the boat soon.

01:15:56.850 --> 01:15:58.450
Right, and how do we get on the boat?

01:16:00.220 --> 01:16:03.340
Lila, I'm not coming with you.

01:16:04.960 --> 01:16:05.880
I've got to get back.

01:16:07.030 --> 01:16:07.610
Come on, you two.

01:16:08.760 --> 01:16:10.510
Take these with you.

01:16:11.300 --> 01:16:11.840
Goodbye, Lila.

01:16:14.390 --> 01:16:19.070
You coming, miss?

01:16:35.020 --> 01:16:37.040
Do you wish to add anything to this statement, Mr. Curtis?

01:16:38.060 --> 01:16:38.420
Nothing.

01:16:39.540 --> 01:16:41.720
Right, you admit striking the blow that felled Winters,

01:16:41.840 --> 01:16:43.520
though you claim you did it to disarm him.

01:16:44.030 --> 01:16:44.310
Yes.

01:16:46.000 --> 01:16:47.060
Was it self-defense, then?

01:16:49.890 --> 01:16:53.000
I suppose so. I came there to look him up.

01:16:55.210 --> 01:16:56.330
Why did you run away, Mr. Curtis?

01:16:57.530 --> 01:16:58.610
I'm not too sure.

01:17:00.060 --> 01:17:02.420
Well, that's something you must figure out for yourself as quickly as possible.

01:17:14.010 --> 01:17:16.630
Miss Ray has testified that when she went to Winter's place of hiding,

01:17:16.730 --> 01:17:18.070
he'd fully recovered from your blow.

01:17:19.840 --> 01:17:22.040
His death was subsequent to her departure from him.

01:17:22.970 --> 01:17:25.410
That tallies with our forensic analysis of the cause of death.

01:17:25.980 --> 01:17:29.280
We believe that we have the killers who are also known to you here in custody.

01:17:31.500 --> 01:17:34.320
Miss Ray further testifies that she withheld this information

01:17:34.320 --> 01:17:36.540
because, for reasons which I hope she will divulge,

01:17:36.880 --> 01:17:39.180
she preferred you to believe that you were responsible for the death.

01:17:43.860 --> 01:17:46.410
I thought if he didn't know, he wouldn't leave me.

01:17:49.220 --> 01:17:49.780
Thank you, Miss Ray.

01:18:00.250 --> 01:18:13.700
she came back. Clear you. What'll happen to her? Well, she'll have to face trial on a charge of

01:18:13.700 --> 01:18:18.300
collusion and robbery. As for you, Mr. Curtis, we have a choice of action in cases like yours.

01:18:18.850 --> 01:18:22.310
Although you were certainly a victim of misadventure, you sought willfully to adjust

01:18:22.310 --> 01:18:29.010
your difficulties by limits outside the law. I think in this case, most of your punishment also

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:32.960
to take place outside the limits of those imposed by the law.

01:18:36.010 --> 01:18:38.760
All right. It'll be all for a moment. Thank you, Mr. Curtis.

01:18:41.790 --> 01:18:43.950
If we want to get in touch with you, we'll know where to find you.

01:18:44.300 --> 01:18:45.880
Thanks. I'll be there.

01:18:57.800 --> 01:18:58.760
What are people saying?

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:02.510
gossip going on. Lots of rumors.

01:19:02.630 --> 01:19:07.080
Nobody actually knows anything. What about

01:19:07.080 --> 01:19:10.680
Elizabeth? What would you like to hear? She's gone

01:19:10.680 --> 01:19:12.560
home to mother, had a good cry, and now

01:19:12.560 --> 01:19:16.950
all is forgiven. I just want to know how

01:19:16.950 --> 01:19:19.720
things stand. Quite a lot, don't you?

01:19:20.910 --> 01:19:26.140
Did she know how things stood? Yeah, you're

01:19:26.140 --> 01:19:26.380
right.

01:19:30.480 --> 01:19:31.420
Does she want a divorce?
